WEBVTT

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:03.640
on the last episode of Dragon Ball Z.

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:07.520
Dende called upon the newly remodeled Dragon Balls

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.280
to summon a new and improved eternal dragon.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.580
The scaly green beast now possessed the power

00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:15.880
to grant two wishes instead of just one.

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:19.360
It was a bargain the ball gatherers just couldn't refuse.

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:22.080
And while the Earth's protectors worked hard

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:23.360
at restoring life above,

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:26.340
a shameless opportunist was taking all the credit

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:28.200
for their victory down below.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.340
Hey!

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:32.410
What a bunch of suckers.

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:34.390
And what a turkey.

00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:39.350
Meanwhile, our heroes wish to heal all those on Earth harmed by the evil cell was granted.

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:42.730
And realized a trip to see Purunga might bring Goku back.

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.710
But Goku had other plans.

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:46.210
Hey, don't I get a say in this?

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:50.330
As a Saiyan baby, I was sent to the Earth to destroy it.

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:52.550
And though all my life I've tried to do the opposite,

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:55.230
it's kind of like I've been fulfilling my mission all along.

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:58.040
So, yeah, I'm going to stay up here now.

00:01:58.510 --> 00:01:59.410
And I really don't mind.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.550
King Kai says I can get special treatment because I save the earth and all, and I'll be able to keep my body.

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:05.630
It'll be a blast.

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:11.830
I guess what I'm trying to say is, I really appreciate your feelings towards me, but you'll have to find something else to wish for.

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:13.410
This is my home now.

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:19.360
You all better take notes of everything that happens in your life, because when they're through, I'm going to want to hear about them.

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:21.020
Until then, goodbye.

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:29.920
So their beloved Goku, who had been both savior and friend, decided to remain.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.980
in the mysterious frontier known as

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:34.020
the Otherworld. But those who

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:35.960
know Goku know that he will be

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:37.460
watching, always

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:38.950
and forever.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:03.790
Make it. It is time now.

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:08.420
Boy, what'd you say, guys? Can anyone think of a good wish?

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:12.210
I'm never able to think of a good wish while the dragon is here.

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:13.010
Me either.

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:15.250
